      <p class="content-split__text">Gift life insurance to secure an estate tax deduction by naming the Community Foundation as a beneficiary. Or donate either a paid-in-full policy or one for which premiums remain to be paid for a current tax deduction.</p>
      <ul class="content-split__list">
        <li>Name the Foundation as a beneficiary for an estate tax deduction</li>
